  <text id="chapter-one-title" x="92" y="270" width="410" height="58" font="body" size="27" color="emerald">Utangulizi wa SMART MANAGER ERP</text>
  <text id="chapter-one-body" x="92" y="350" width="420" height="148" font="body" size="19" color="ink" line-height="1.38"><p>• Rekodi zilizotawanyika huleta hitaji la mpangilio.</p><p>• ERP inaelezwa kwa Kiswahili rahisi na mipaka ya ushahidi.</p><p>• Mtazamaji hupewa ramani ya safari ya sura 48.</p></text>
  <shape id="chapter-two-card" type="rect" x="710" y="190" width="510" height="350" fill="#EAF1EE" stroke="#B7D4C9" stroke-width="1"/>
