  <text id="chapter-two-title" x="742" y="270" width="410" height="58" font="body" size="27" color="emerald">Maono, Tatizo na Suluhisho</text>
  <text id="chapter-two-body" x="742" y="350" width="420" height="148" font="body" size="19" color="ink" line-height="1.38"><p>• Tatizo linawekwa wazi kabla ya kuchagua moduli.</p><p>• Mtiririko mmoja wa thamani huanza kwa udhibiti.</p><p>• 3D huonyesha dhana; haidai matokeo ya biashara.</p></text>
  <shape id="sequence-arrow" type="arrow" x="594" y="332" width="92" height="54" fill="gold" head-ratio="0.38"/>
  <text id="sequence-label" x="582" y="402" width="116" height="42" font="caption" size="13" color="slate" align="center" line-height="1.1"><p>Fahamu tatizo</p><p>kisha anza</p></text>
  <shape id="takeaway-band" type="rect" x="60" y="570" width="1160" height="56" fill="emerald"/>
  <text id="takeaway-text" x="84" y="585" width="1110" height="24" font="body" size="18" color="ivory" align="center" wrap="false">Kanuni ya mwanzo: chagua mtiririko unaohitaji mpangilio, kisha jenga ushahidi wake kwa hatua.</text>
